# Source archives must exclude operational data and private signing material,
# even if someone accidentally force-adds a normally ignored path.
**/dist/** export-ignore
**/.tools/** export-ignore
**/.pnpm-home/** export-ignore
**/logs/** export-ignore
**/attachments/** export-ignore
**/snapshots/** export-ignore
**/events.ndjson* export-ignore
**/network.json export-ignore
**/aprs-credentials.json export-ignore
**/aprs-passcode export-ignore
**/integration-cache.json export-ignore
**/*.log export-ignore
**/*.key export-ignore
**/*.pem export-ignore
**/*.p12 export-ignore
**/*.pfx export-ignore
**/id_rsa* export-ignore
**/id_ed25519* export-ignore
